  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Nutrition Support for the Ebola Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food component of the ongoing Ebola Response. Provision of food to patients, caretakers, isolated individuals and support staff. This initial funding will enable WFP to establish the food distribution system (both dry and wet) that can be scaled up, should the situation escalate.
Support to 7500 people for an initial 3 months.</narrative>
  </description>
